    'Docker Compose applications mount the volume from their compose file. Coolify shows the lines to add.' => 'Docker Compose 应用会按其 Compose 文件挂载该卷。Coolify 会显示需要添加的行。',
    'Docker images stored on this server. Images that no container uses can be deleted here.' => '存储在此服务器上的 Docker 镜像。没有被任何容器使用的镜像可在此删除。',
    'Docker networks used to isolate and connect resources on this server.' => '用于隔离和连接此服务器上资源的 Docker 网络。',
    'Docker volumes that the Docker Compose file declares with external: true. Coolify mounts them as written.' => 'Docker Compose 文件中以 external: true 声明的 Docker 卷。Coolify 会按原样挂载。',
    'Docker: each job gets a private Docker daemon. The daemon runs privileged, so a job can get root access to this server. Use it only for trusted repositories.' => 'Docker：每个任务获得一个私有 Docker 守护进程。该守护进程以特权方式运行，因此任务可能获得此服务器的 root 权限。请仅用于可信仓库。',
    'Domain validation and the internal targets that outbound requests may reach.' => '域名校验，以及出站请求可访问的内部目标。',
    'Domain will be assigned to this compose service application.' => '域名将分配给此 Compose 服务应用。',
    'Drain logs to the log drain endpoint configured in your Server settings.' => '将日志外发到服务器设置中配置的日志外发端点。',
    'Driver options. Use one key=value pair per line, or a YAML mapping.' => '驱动选项。每行填写一个 key=value 键值对，或使用 YAML 映射。',
    'Drops each collection from the backup before restoring it. Without this option, documents that already exist are skipped.' => '恢复前先删除备份中的每个集合。不启用此选项时，已存在的文档会被跳过。',
    'Each backup is uploaded to every selected storage.' => '每份备份都会上传到每一个已选存储。',
    'Each step doubles the work to check or crack the password. Traefik checks the password on every request, so a higher cost makes every request slower.' => '每一步都会让校验或破解密码的工作量翻倍。Traefik 对每个请求都要校验密码，因此成本越高，每个请求越慢。',
    'Each workflow job runs in a new container that is deleted after the job.' => '每个工作流任务都在一个新容器中运行，任务结束后该容器会被删除。',
    'Each workflow job runs in a new container that is deleted after the job. Use runs-on: [self-hosted,' => '每个工作流任务都在一个新容器中运行，任务结束后该容器会被删除。使用 runs-on: [self-hosted,',
    'Edit the generated proxy compose configuration used on this server.' => '编辑此服务器上使用的、由 Coolify 生成的代理 Compose 配置。',
    'Empty uses the latest official runner image, which Coolify pulls for every runner. Set a tag, for example ghcr.io/actions/actions-runner:2.337.0, to pin a version, or use a custom image based on the official one to add tools. GitHub stops sending jobs to runners that are more than 30 days old.' => '留空则使用最新的官方运行器镜像，Coolify 会为每个运行器拉取它。填写标签（例如 ghcr.io/actions/actions-runner:2.337.0）可固定版本，也可使用基于官方镜像的自定义镜像来添加工具。GitHub 会停止向超过 30 天的运行器派发任务。',
    'Enter a tag (e.g., \'latest\', \'v1.2.3\') or SHA256 hash (e.g., \'sha256-59e02939b1bf39f16c93138a28727aec520bb916da021180ae502c61626b3cf0\')' => '输入标签（例如 \'latest\'、\'v1.2.3\'）或 SHA256 哈希（例如 \'sha256-59e02939b1bf39f16c93138a28727aec520bb916da021180ae502c61626b3cf0\'）',
    'Enter the full URL of the instance (for example, https://dashboard.example.com).' => '输入实例的完整 URL（例如 https://dashboard.example.com）。',
    'Environment variables (secrets) for this resource.' => '此资源的环境变量（机密）。',
    'Events per second above which Sentinel starts sampling. 0 disables sampling.' => '每秒事件数超过此值时 Sentinel 开始采样。填 0 表示禁用采样。',
    'Example usage:' => '用法示例：',
    'Execution history refreshes automatically while a task is running.' => '任务运行期间执行历史会自动刷新。',
    'Existing keys from the DigitalOcean account.' => 'DigitalOcean 账户中已有的密钥。',
    'Existing keys from the Hetzner account.' => 'Hetzner 账户中已有的密钥。',
    'Existing keys from the Hostinger account.' => 'Hostinger 账户中已有的密钥。',
    'Existing keys from the Vultr account.' => 'Vultr 账户中已有的密钥。',
    'Expose the authenticated Streamable HTTP endpoint at /mcp.' => '在 /mcp 暴露需认证的 Streamable HTTP 端点。',
    'Expose this database through the managed TCP proxy.' => '通过托管的 TCP 代理暴露此数据库。',
    'Fills in the host, port, and encryption of the provider. You then enter the username and password from the provider.' => '自动填入该提供商的主机、端口与加密方式。随后请输入提供商给出的用户名和密码。',
    'For example 127.0.0.1 or server.example.com.' => '例如 127.0.0.1 或 server.example.com。',
    'For example, pr_1234.' => '例如 pr_1234。',
    'For one target IP, from all teams together, in the window. From 1 to 1000.' => '针对单个目标 IP、所有团队合计、在该时间窗口内的次数。取值 1 到 1000。',
    'For one team, to all IPs together, in the window. From 1 to 10000.' => '针对单个团队、所有 IP 合计、在该时间窗口内的次数。取值 1 到 10000。',
    'For self-hosted GitLab, enter your instance URL (e.g. https://gitlab.example.com).' => '自建 GitLab 请填写你的实例 URL（例如 https://gitlab.example.com）。',
    'For self-hosted Gitea or Forgejo, enter your instance URL (e.g. https://git.example.com).' => '自建 Gitea 或 Forgejo 请填写你的实例 URL（例如 https://git.example.com）。',
    'Forced cleanup runs on every schedule without waiting for the threshold.' => '强制清理会在每个计划点运行，不等待磁盘占用达到阈值。',
    'Forward container logs from this server to an external destination.' => '将此服务器的容器日志转发到外部目标。',
    'Forward container logs from this server to one external destination.' => '将此服务器的容器日志转发到一个外部目标。',
    'Forward container logs to the drain configured on the server.' => '将容器日志转发到该服务器上配置的日志外发端点。',
    'Fully qualified domain sent in the SMTP EHLO command. Uses the system default when empty.' => 'SMTP EHLO 命令中发送的完全限定域名。留空则使用系统默认值。',
    'Git repository (based on the base directory settings) will be copied to the deployment directory.' => 'Git 仓库（依据基础目录设置）会被复制到部署目录。',
    'GitLab Apps cannot register repository webhooks, so add this webhook to the GitLab project yourself.' => 'GitLab App 无法注册仓库 Webhook，因此请自行将此 Webhook 添加到 GitLab 项目。',
    'GitLab will use this custom public URL. Do not include /webhooks.' => 'GitLab 将使用此自定义公网 URL。不要包含 /webhooks。',
    'GitLab will use this endpoint unless custom mode is enabled.' => '除非启用自定义模式，GitLab 将使用此端点。',
    'Gitea or Forgejo will use this custom public URL. Do not include /webhooks.' => 'Gitea 或 Forgejo 将使用此自定义公网 URL。不要包含 /webhooks。',
    'Gitea or Forgejo will use this endpoint unless custom mode is enabled.' => '除非启用自定义模式，Gitea 或 Forgejo 将使用此端点。',
    'Hide every environment variable value in deployment logs, scheduled task output, copied or downloaded logs, and logs from the API and MCP. Live log streaming is not changed. Locked variables and known secret formats are always hidden.' => '在部署日志、计划任务输出、复制或下载的日志，以及来自 API 和 MCP 的日志中隐藏所有环境变量的值。实时日志流不受影响。已锁定的变量和已知的机密格式始终会被隐藏。',
    'Hide password registration whenever at least one OAuth provider is enabled.' => '只要启用至少一个 OAuth 提供商，就隐藏密码注册。',
    'Hostinger charges extra for backups. Check the price in hPanel before you enable them.' => 'Hostinger 对备份另外收费。启用前请先在 hPanel 中确认价格。',
    'Hostinger runs this as /post_install after setup and writes output to /post_install.log.' => 'Hostinger 会在初始化后将其作为 /post_install 运行，并把输出写入 /post_install.log。',
    'Hostnames, IPs, or CIDR ranges separated by commas or new lines.' => '以逗号或换行分隔的主机名、IP 或 CIDR 网段。',
    'How Sentinel stores visitor IPs for the Top IPs list. Anonymized keeps only the network. Disabled does not store IPs or visitor cities. When you change this setting, Sentinel deletes the stored IPs that the new setting does not allow.' => 'Sentinel 为「热门 IP」列表存储访客 IP 的方式。选择「匿名化」只保留网段；选择「禁用」则不存储 IP 或访客城市。修改此设置时，Sentinel 会删除新设置不允许的已存 IP。',
    'If checked, this GitLab App will be available for everyone in this Coolify instance.' => '勾选后，此 GitLab App 将对此 Coolify 实例中的所有人可用。',
    'If checked, this Gitea / Forgejo App will be available for everyone in this Coolify instance.' => '勾选后，此 Gitea / Forgejo App 将对此 Coolify 实例中的所有人可用。',
    'If you use this, you need to specify paths relatively and should use the same compose file in the custom command, otherwise the automatically configured labels / etc won\'t work.' => '使用此项时，路径需要写为相对路径，并在自定义命令中使用同一个 Compose 文件，否则自动配置的标签等将无法生效。',
    'If you want to use env variables inside the labels, turn this off.' => '如需在标签内使用环境变量，请关闭此项。',
    'Inspect CPU and memory usage for this application.' => '查看此应用的 CPU 与内存使用情况。',
    'Isolated Docker: each job gets a private Docker daemon in an unprivileged Sysbox container. Everything that needs Docker works, and root in the job has no rights on this server. Needs Sysbox on the server.' => '隔离 Docker：每个任务在不特权的 Sysbox 容器中获得私有 Docker 守护进程。所有依赖 Docker 的操作都可运行，且任务内的 root 对此服务器没有权限。需要在服务器上安装 Sysbox。',
    'Jobs wait in the queue when all runners are busy.' => '当所有运行器都在忙碌时，任务会在队列中等待。',
    'Keep previously built Docker images available for fast rollbacks. Rollback uses an existing image without rebuilding the application. Images in the Docker registry are pulled to the server first.' => '保留此前构建的 Docker 镜像以便快速回滚。回滚会直接使用已有镜像，不重新构建应用。Docker 仓库中的镜像会先拉取到服务器。',
    'Keep these values aligned with the credentials configured inside ClickHouse.' => '请保持这些值与 ClickHouse 内部配置的凭据一致。',
    'Keep these values aligned with the credentials configured inside Dragonfly.' => '请保持这些值与 Dragonfly 内部配置的凭据一致。',
    'Keep these values aligned with the credentials configured inside MariaDB.' => '请保持这些值与 MariaDB 内部配置的凭据一致。',
    'Keep these values aligned with the credentials configured inside MongoDB.' => '请保持这些值与 MongoDB 内部配置的凭据一致。',
    'Keep these values aligned with the credentials configured inside MySQL.' => '请保持这些值与 MySQL 内部配置的凭据一致。',
    'Keep these values aligned with the credentials configured inside PostgreSQL.' => '请保持这些值与 PostgreSQL 内部配置的凭据一致。',
    'Keep these values aligned with the credentials configured inside Redis / Valkey.' => '请保持这些值与 Redis / Valkey 内部配置的凭据一致。',
    'Keep this value aligned with the password configured inside KeyDB.' => '请保持此值与 KeyDB 内部配置的密码一致。',
    'Known vulnerabilities in the operating system packages of this server. Coolify scans them with the image scanner every day and after a package update. Problems that the distribution does not fix are not shown.' => '此服务器操作系统软件包中的已知漏洞。Coolify 每天以及每次软件包更新后会用镜像扫描器检查。发行版未修复的问题不会显示。',
    'Labels are readonly by default. Readonly means that edits you do to the labels could be lost and Coolify will autogenerate the labels for you. If you want to edit the labels directly, disable this option.' => '标签默认只读。只读意味着你对标签所做的修改可能丢失，Coolify 会为你自动生成标签。如需直接编辑标签，请关闭此选项。',
    'Leave empty to return a 503 response instead of redirecting.' => '留空则返回 503 响应而不重定向。',
    'Leave empty to use the default Sentinel image.' => '留空则使用默认的 Sentinel 镜像。',
    'Let users sign in with a passkey. Passkeys need an HTTPS instance URL. Stored passkeys are kept when this is disabled.' => '允许用户使用通行密钥登录。通行密钥需要 HTTPS 的实例 URL。关闭此项时已存储的通行密钥仍会保留。',
    'Limit how much CPU volume backup compression may use on this server.' => '限制在此服务器上压缩卷备份时可使用的 CPU 上限。',
    'Limits apply to the runner container and to its Docker sidecar.' => '限制同时适用于运行器容器及其 Docker 边车容器。',
    'Limits failed SSH validations, so users cannot make Coolify Cloud try logins on hosts that they do not own. Successful connections do not count.' => '限制失败的 SSH 校验次数，避免用户让 Coolify Cloud 在其不拥有的主机上尝试登录。成功的连接不计入。',
    'Limits of each scanner step on this server. Raise one when a scan stops because it took too long or ran out of memory. A new limit applies to the next scan.' => '此服务器上各扫描步骤的限制。当扫描因耗时过长或内存不足而中断时请调高相应限制。新限制从下次扫描开始生效。',
    'Literal means $VARIABLES in the value is kept as the actual characters \'$VARIABLES\' instead of being resolved from another variable. Useful when your value contains a $ sign.' => '「字面量」表示值中的 $VARIABLES 会保留为实际字符 \'$VARIABLES\'，而不会被解析为另一个变量。当你的值包含 $ 符号时很有用。',
    'Local testing controls that are unavailable in production.' => '本地测试用的控制项，在生产环境中不可用。',
    'Loopback targets must also be present in the allowlist.' => '回环目标也必须出现在允许列表中。',
    'Manage additional runtime proxy configuration.' => '管理额外的运行时代理配置。',
    'Manage database, persistent volume, and directory backup schedules for this service.' => '管理此服务的数据库、持久卷与目录备份计划。',
    'Manage domains, deployments, logs, and lifecycle actions for configured previews.' => '管理已配置预览的域名、部署、日志与生命周期操作。',
    'Manage how this application is reached publicly, who can access it, and how it is reached from the Docker network.' => '管理此应用的公网访问方式、访问权限，以及从 Docker 网络访问它的方式。',
    'Manage the certificate authority used to sign database certificates on this server.' => '管理用于为此服务器上数据库证书签名的证书颁发机构。',
    'Manual repository webhooks are only required when a repository is not connected through an official Git App.' => '仅当仓库未通过官方 Git App 连接时，才需要手动配置仓库 Webhook。',
    'Maximum backup runtime in seconds.' => '备份的最长运行时间（秒）。',
    'Maximum delivery time in seconds.' => '最长投递时间（秒）。',
    'Maximum deployment duration in seconds.' => '最长部署时长（秒）。',
    'Maximum deployments that can build at the same time.' => '可同时构建的最大部署数量。',
    'Maximum distinct values kept per dimension (paths, countries, browsers). Overflow folds into Other.' => '每个维度（路径、国家、浏览器）保留的最大不同取值数。超出的部分归入「其他」。',
    'Maximum number of Docker restarts before Coolify stops this container. Set to 0 to disable the limit. Docker counts expected and unexpected restarts.' => 'Docker 重启多少次后 Coolify 停止此容器。设为 0 表示不限制。Docker 会统计预期内与预期外的重启。',
    'Maximum number of recent S3 backups.' => '保留最近 S3 备份的最大数量。',
    'Maximum number of recent local backups.' => '保留最近本地备份的最大数量。',
    'Maximum queued deployments before new requests are rejected.' => '队列中最多可排队的部署数，超过后新请求会被拒绝。',
    'Maximum runtime in seconds of the complete backup run: the dumps and S3 uploads of all databases.' => '整次备份运行的最长时长（秒）：包括所有数据库的导出与 S3 上传。',
    'Memory for each runner, for example 4g. Empty means no limit.' => '每个运行器的内存，例如 4g。留空表示不限制。',
    'Memory that each scanner step can use. Values above the memory of this server are not listed. The server must also have this much free memory when a scan runs.' => '每个扫描步骤可使用的内存。高于本服务器内存的值不会列出。扫描运行时服务器也必须有这么多空闲内存。',
    'Memory that the proxy needs to check a password. More memory makes the hash harder to crack, but every login attempt that the proxy has not seen before uses this much memory on the server.' => '代理校验密码所需的内存。内存越多，哈希越难破解，但代理此前未处理过的每次登录尝试都会在服务器上占用这么多内存。',
    'Minimum time between high disk usage notifications for this server.' => '此服务器磁盘占用过高通知之间的最短间隔。',
    'Monitor server and container health while collecting historical metrics.' => '采集历史指标的同时监控服务器与容器健康状况。',
    'Monitor server and container health while collecting metrics.' => '采集指标的同时监控服务器与容器健康状况。',
    'More details in the' => '更多细节见',
    'Most requested paths for the selected range.' => '所选时间范围内请求最多的路径。',
    'Move this resource to a different validated and reachable server. The resource is stopped and persistent volumes can be transferred.' => '将此资源迁移到另一台已校验且可达的服务器。迁移时资源会被停止，持久卷可以一并转移。',
    'NOT work with Traefik' => '无法与 Traefik 配合使用',
    'Name of a certificate resolver defined in the Traefik configuration of this server.' => '此服务器 Traefik 配置中定义的证书解析器名称。',
    'Name of a certificate resolver defined in your Traefik configuration. Letters, numbers, hyphens, and underscores only.' => '你的 Traefik 配置中定义的证书解析器名称。仅限字母、数字、连字符和下划线。',
    'Name shown in email from Resend.' => 'Resend 邮件中显示的名称。',
    'Name shown in email from this server.' => '本服务器邮件中显示的名称。',
    'Name shown in notification emails (deployments, backups, server alerts) to teams that use the instance email settings.' => '在使用实例邮件设置的团队收到的通知邮件（部署、备份、服务器告警）中显示的名称。',
    'Name to find this server in the SMTP server list.' => '在 SMTP 服务器列表中查找此服务器所用的名称。',
    'Named Docker volumes and bind-mount host paths are transferred when both servers are managed by Coolify.' => '当两台服务器都由 Coolify 管理时，命名 Docker 卷与绑定挂载的宿主路径会一并转移。',
    'Naming, shutdown, logs, and GPU access for the deployed container.' => '已部署容器的命名、关闭行为、日志与 GPU 访问。',
    'Networks found on the server that are not registered as Coolify destinations.' => '服务器上发现的、尚未注册为 Coolify 目标的网络。',
    'New resources can receive generated subdomains from this domain.' => '新资源可以从该域名获得自动生成的子域名。',
    'No Docker: jobs run in an unprivileged container. JavaScript actions, composite actions, and shell steps work. Docker container actions, services, container jobs, and docker commands fail.' => '无 Docker：任务在不特权容器中运行。JavaScript 动作、复合动作与 shell 步骤可正常工作；Docker 容器动作、服务、容器任务以及 docker 命令会失败。',
    'No health check configured.' => '未配置健康检查。',
    'Non-root SSH users are experimental.' => '非 root 的 SSH 用户为实验性功能。',
    'Notify the team when root filesystem usage exceeds this percentage.' => '根文件系统使用率超过此百分比时通知团队。',
    'Notify through backup failure channels after this many days without an execution. Use 0 to disable.' => '超过这么多天没有执行时，通过备份失败通知渠道提醒。填 0 表示禁用。',
    'Number of CPUs for each runner. Empty means no limit.' => '每个运行器的 CPU 数量。留空表示不限制。',
    'Number of passes over the memory. More iterations make the hash harder to crack and a password check slower.' => '对内存的遍历次数。迭代次数越多，哈希越难破解，密码校验也越慢。',
    'OAuth credentials and the endpoints Coolify uses to reach this source.' => 'OAuth 凭据，以及 Coolify 访问此源所使用的端点。',
    'OAuth providers can still create users when registration is enabled for that provider.' => '当某 OAuth 提供商启用了注册时，该提供商仍可创建用户。',
    'Off: the system databases (mysql, sys) of the backup are skipped, so this database keeps its own users and passwords. On: the users, passwords, and privileges of the backup replace the current ones.' => '关闭：跳过备份中的系统数据库（mysql、sys），此数据库保留自己的用户与密码。开启：备份中的用户、密码与权限会替换当前的设置。',
    'One line for each key: host key-type key. Use [host]:port for a custom SSH port. GitHub and Bitbucket Cloud use their published keys and cannot be added here. Click Save to apply.' => '每个密钥一行：host key-type key。自定义 SSH 端口请使用 [host]:port。GitHub 与 Bitbucket Cloud 使用其公开的密钥，无法在此添加。点击「保存」生效。',
    'One minute load average reported by the server.' => '服务器上报的一分钟平均负载。',
    'Only change this for self-hosted GitLab (e.g. https://gitlab.example.com).' => '仅自建 GitLab 才需要修改此项（例如 https://gitlab.example.com）。',
    'Only change this for self-hosted Gitea or Forgejo (e.g. https://git.example.com).' => '仅自建 Gitea 或 Forgejo 才需要修改此项（例如 https://git.example.com）。',
    'Only for Vault Enterprise / HCP Vault.' => '仅适用于 Vault Enterprise / HCP Vault。',
    'OpenID Provider issuer URL, for example https://example.okta.com. Coolify uses it to discover the authorization, token, userinfo, and JWKS endpoints. For Microsoft Entra ID, use https://login.microsoftonline.com/&lt;tenant ID&gt;/v2.0 and add the optional ID token claims email and xms_edov to the app registration.' => 'OpenID 提供商的 issuer URL，例如 https://example.okta.com。Coolify 用它发现授权、令牌、userinfo 与 JWKS 端点。使用 Microsoft Entra ID 时请填 https://login.microsoftonline.com/&lt;租户 ID&gt;/v2.0，并在应用注册中添加可选的 ID 令牌声明 email 与 xms_edov。',
    'Operating system and hardware details for the server running this Coolify instance.' => '运行此 Coolify 实例的服务器的操作系统与硬件信息。',
    'Optional RSA private key used to sign Cloudflare Domain Connect apply URLs on Coolify Cloud. Leave blank to keep the existing key.' => '用于为 Coolify Cloud 上的 Cloudflare Domain Connect 申请 URL 签名的可选 RSA 私钥。留空则保留现有密钥。',
    'Optional public URL (for example a CDN or public bucket domain) that serves profile pictures and project icons stored on S3. Leave empty to serve them through Coolify.' => '可选的公网 URL（例如 CDN 或公开存储桶域名），用于提供存储在 S3 上的头像与项目图标。留空则经 Coolify 提供。',
    'Optional. Comma-separated group names to filter repositories (e.g. myorg,myteam).' => '可选。以逗号分隔的组名，用于筛选仓库（例如 myorg,myteam）。',
    'Optional. Comma-separated group names to filter repositories.' => '可选。以逗号分隔的组名，用于筛选仓库。',
    'Optional. Comma-separated organization or user names to filter repositories (e.g. myorg,myuser).' => '可选。以逗号分隔的组织或用户名，用于筛选仓库（例如 myorg,myuser）。',
    'Optional. Comma-separated organization or user names to filter repositories.' => '可选。以逗号分隔的组织或用户名，用于筛选仓库。',
    'Optional. Log streams are named after the container, prefixed with this value (e.g. docker/&lt;container name&gt;).' => '可选。日志流以容器名命名，并在前面加上此值（例如 docker/&lt;容器名&gt;）。',
    'Organization GitHub App that receives the Workflow job webhook events.' => '接收 Workflow 任务 Webhook 事件的组织级 GitHub App。',
    'Organization permission. Write access is needed to register runners.' => '组织级权限。注册运行器需要写权限。',
    'Override endpoints and SSH settings for self-hosted GitLab.' => '为自建 GitLab 覆盖端点与 SSH 设置。',
    'Override endpoints and SSH settings for self-hosted Gitea or Forgejo.' => '为自建 Gitea 或 Forgejo 覆盖端点与 SSH 设置。',
    'Override only the KeyDB directives you need. All other defaults remain active.' => '仅覆盖你需要的 KeyDB 指令，其余默认值仍然生效。',
    'Override only the Redis / Valkey directives you need. All other defaults remain active.' => '仅覆盖你需要的 Redis / Valkey 指令，其余默认值仍然生效。',
    'Override the MariaDB configuration used by this container.' => '覆盖此容器使用的 MariaDB 配置。',
    'Override the MongoDB configuration used by this container.' => '覆盖此容器使用的 MongoDB 配置。',
    'Override the MySQL configuration used by this container.' => '覆盖此容器使用的 MySQL 配置。',
    'Override the PostgreSQL configuration used by this container.' => '覆盖此容器使用的 PostgreSQL 配置。',
    'Package discovery runs in the background and can take several minutes.' => '软件包发现会在后台运行，可能需要几分钟。',
    'Paste a PEM private key to set or rotate. Public key must be published at domainconnect.coolify.io. Env DOMAIN_CONNECT_PRIVATE_KEY is used as a fallback when this is empty.' => '粘贴 PEM 私钥以设置或轮换。公钥必须发布在 domainconnect.coolify.io。此处为空时会回退使用环境变量 DOMAIN_CONNECT_PRIVATE_KEY。',
    'Paste a complete image reference, or enter a name and use one of the optional fields below.' => '粘贴完整的镜像引用，或输入名称并使用下方任一可选字段。',
    'Path to the backup file in the storage, e.g., /backups/database-2025-01-15.gz' => '备份文件在存储中的路径，例如 /backups/database-2025-01-15.gz',
    'Percentage of physical memory currently used by this server.' => '此服务器当前已使用的物理内存百分比。',
    'Percentage of the root filesystem used by this server.' => '此服务器已使用的根文件系统百分比。',
    'Permanently remove this server and its configuration from Coolify.' => '从 Coolify 中永久移除此服务器及其配置。',
    'Permanently remove volumes not attached to running containers.' => '永久删除未挂载到运行中容器的卷。',
    'PocketBase keeps compression disabled so server-sent events continue to work.' => 'PocketBase 会保持压缩关闭，以保证服务器发送事件（SSE）正常工作。',
    'Port the application listens on.' => '应用监听的端口。',
    'Pre-selects image scanning when someone adds a server to this team. They can change it.' => '有人向此团队添加服务器时预先勾选镜像扫描。对方可以自行更改。',
    'Prefetch pages and navigate without full reloads.' => '预取页面，并在不整页刷新的情况下导航。',
    'Preview deployments are always excluded from search indexing.' => '预览部署始终不会被搜索引擎收录。',
    'Provider state, operating system, and hardware details.' => '提供商状态、操作系统与硬件信息。',
    'Proxy SSH traffic through Cloudflare so the server SSH port can remain closed.' => '通过 Cloudflare 代理 SSH 流量，从而让服务器 SSH 端口保持关闭。',
    'Public URL used by Sentinel to reach this Coolify instance.' => 'Sentinel 访问此 Coolify 实例所用的公网 URL。',
    'Queued jobs, active runners, and their results. The list updates every 10 seconds.' => '排队的任务、活跃的运行器及其结果。列表每 10 秒更新一次。',
    'REDIS_PASSWORD is locked. Its value is never shown again.' => 'REDIS_PASSWORD 已锁定，其值不会再显示。',
    'Read access is mandatory.' => '必须具有读权限。',
    'Read-only preview routing configuration.' => '只读的预览路由配置。',
    'Receive and transmit rate across the server\'s network interfaces.' => '服务器各网络接口的接收与发送速率。',
    'Refetch to update this list after you change the App on GitHub.' => '在 GitHub 上修改 App 后，请重新获取以更新此列表。',
    'Remove Docker networks not attached to running containers.' => '删除未挂载到运行中容器的 Docker 网络。',
    'Remove S3 backups older than this many days.' => '删除早于该天数的 S3 备份。',
    'Remove local backups older than this many days.' => '删除早于该天数的本地备份。',
    'Remove the oldest S3 backups after this total size is reached.' => '总大小达到此值后删除最旧的 S3 备份。',
    'Remove the oldest local backups after this total size is reached.' => '总大小达到此值后删除最旧的本地备份。',
    'Remove unused Docker data and keep disk usage under control.' => '清理未使用的 Docker 数据，控制磁盘占用。',
    'Replaces the operating system selected above. Applications and panels, such as another Coolify or CyberPanel, can conflict with the Coolify proxy on ports 80 and 443.' => '替换上方选择的操作系统。其他应用与面板（例如另一个 Coolify 或 CyberPanel）可能与 Coolify 代理在 80 和 443 端口上冲突。',
    'Repository directory used as the build root.' => '用作构建根目录的仓库目录。',
    'Repository permission. Read access is needed for the Workflow job webhook event.' => '仓库级权限。Workflow 任务 Webhook 事件需要读权限。',
    'Repository permission. Write access is needed to create deployments and their statuses.' => '仓库级权限。创建部署及其状态需要写权限。',
    'Request volume by visitor country and city for the selected range.' => '所选时间范围内按访客国家与城市划分的请求量。',
    'Review Coolify-managed resources and other Docker containers running on this server.' => '查看此服务器上由 Coolify 管理的资源以及其他 Docker 容器。',
    'Review backup runs across every database and storage target in this service.' => '查看此服务中每个数据库与存储目标的备份运行记录。',
    'Review backup runs across every schedule of this database.' => '查看此数据库每个计划的备份运行记录。',
    'Review certificates stored by Traefik for this server.' => '查看 Traefik 为此服务器存储的证书。',
    'Review certificates stored in Traefik\'s acme.json file. Traefik renews every certificate in this file, also when no route uses its domain any more. Deleting an entry removes it from local ACME storage. It does not revoke the certificate at the certificate authority. If a route still uses the domain, Traefik requests a new certificate after the restart.' => '查看 Traefik 的 acme.json 文件中存储的证书。Traefik 会续期此文件中的每张证书，即使已没有任何路由使用其域名。删除条目只是将其从本地 ACME 存储中移除，并不会在证书颁发机构处吊销证书。若仍有路由使用该域名，Traefik 会在重启后重新申请证书。',
    'Review cleanup status, duration, and command output.' => '查看清理状态、耗时与命令输出。',
    'Review or replace the PEM certificate stored on this server.' => '查看或替换此服务器上存储的 PEM 证书。',
    'Rolling update is not supported if you have a port mapped to the host.' => '若有端口映射到宿主机，则不支持滚动更新。',
    'Run cleanup after disk usage exceeds this percentage.' => '磁盘占用超过此百分比后执行清理。',
    'Runners fail jobs that a pull request started (pull_request, pull_request_target, and review events) before any step runs. Push, schedule, and manual jobs always run. Applies to runners that start after you save.' => '运行器会让由拉取请求触发的任务（pull_request、pull_request_target 与 review 事件）在任何步骤执行前直接失败。Push、定时与手动任务始终会运行。仅对保存之后启动的运行器生效。',
    'Runs this backup once before every manual or automatic update, in addition to the schedule. It does not run when the backup schedule is disabled.' => '除计划之外，每次手动或自动更新前都会运行一次此备份。备份计划被禁用时不会运行。',
    'Search by token name, ability, or the name of a project, environment, or resource that the token can use.' => '按令牌名称、权限，或该令牌可使用的项目、环境、资源名称搜索。',
    'Search, filter, and open a deployment to inspect its build logs.' => '搜索、筛选并打开某次部署以查看其构建日志。',
    'Search, filter, follow, copy, or download recent output from the Coolify proxy container.' => '搜索、筛选、跟踪、复制或下载 Coolify 代理容器最近的输出。',
    'Seconds between health reports sent to Coolify.' => '发送到 Coolify 的健康报告之间的间隔秒数。',
    'Seconds between metric samples.' => '指标采样之间的间隔秒数。',
    'Seconds to wait before an SSH connection fails.' => 'SSH 连接失败前等待的秒数。',
    'Seconds to wait for each request. Increase it if your instance responds slowly.' => '每个请求的等待秒数。如果实例响应较慢请调高。',
    'Secrets:' => '机密：',
    'Select a detected Docker Compose file, or type a path relative to the base directory.' => '选择一个检测到的 Docker Compose 文件，或输入相对于基础目录的路径。',
    'Select a detected Dockerfile, or type a path relative to the base directory.' => '选择一个检测到的 Dockerfile，或输入相对于基础目录的路径。',
    'Send container logs directly to CloudWatch Logs using the Docker awslogs logging driver.' => '使用 Docker 的 awslogs 日志驱动将容器日志直接发送到 CloudWatch Logs。',
    'Send logs through the New Relic Log API.' => '通过 New Relic Log API 发送日志。',
    'Send logs to an Axiom dataset using its ingest API.' => '使用 Axiom 的摄取 API 将日志发送到某个数据集。',
    'Served hostnames ranked by request volume.' => '按请求量排序的已服务主机名。',
    'Set deployment concurrency, execution timeouts, and queue capacity.' => '设置部署并发数、执行超时与队列容量。',
    'Set this as the Secret in a Gitea webhook (user, organization, or repository settings → Webhooks → Add webhook → Gitea or Forgejo), content type application/json, trigger on Push and Pull Request events. Stored encrypted.' => '在 Gitea 的 Webhook 中将其设为 Secret（用户、组织或仓库设置 → Webhooks → 添加 Webhook → Gitea 或 Forgejo），内容类型选 application/json，触发事件选 Push 与 Pull Request。存储时加密。',
    'Set this same token in your GitLab webhook\'s Secret token field. Stored encrypted.' => '在 GitLab Webhook 的「Secret token」字段中填入同一令牌。存储时加密。',
    'Set to 0 to keep only the running image. Pull request images are always removed during cleanup.' => '设为 0 表示只保留正在运行的镜像。拉取请求镜像在清理时总会被删除。',
    'Sets how many CPU threads can be used to compress volume backups, based on this server\'s available CPUs.' => '设置压缩卷备份可使用的 CPU 线程数，取决于此服务器可用的 CPU。',
    'Sets the Traefik certificate resolver for this service\'s HTTPS routes. Choose None for domains that use certificates from Traefik\'s dynamic configuration (for example Cloudflare Origin CA certificates). Restart or redeploy the service to apply the change.' => '为此服务的 HTTPS 路由设置 Traefik 证书解析器。若域名使用 Traefik 动态配置中的证书（例如 Cloudflare Origin CA 证书），请选择「无」。重启或重新部署服务以应用更改。',
    'Share of requests by client device class for the selected range.' => '所选时间范围内按客户端设备类别划分的请求占比。',
    'Share of responses by HTTP status class for the selected range.' => '所选时间范围内按 HTTP 状态类别划分的响应占比。',
    'Show the monthly project sponsorship reminder.' => '显示每月的项目赞助提醒。',
    'Static: the final build assets are served as a static site. SPA: a static site with single-page-app routing.' => '静态：最终构建产物作为静态站点提供。SPA：带单页应用路由的静态站点。',
    'Stored encrypted. Leave empty to keep the existing secret.' => '加密存储。留空则保留现有机密。',
    'Switch registries if the current source is rate limited.' => '当前源被限流时切换镜像仓库。',
    'System-wide GitHub Apps can be used by every team on this Coolify instance.' => '系统级 GitHub App 可供此 Coolify 实例上的所有团队使用。',
    'The Application ID from your GitLab OAuth Application.' => '你的 GitLab OAuth 应用的 Application ID。',
    'The Client ID from your Gitea or Forgejo OAuth2 application.' => '你的 Gitea 或 Forgejo OAuth2 应用的 Client ID。',
    'The Client secret from your Gitea or Forgejo OAuth2 application. Saved encrypted.' => '你的 Gitea 或 Forgejo OAuth2 应用的 Client secret。保存时加密。',
    'The Coolify instance that this server was transferred to.' => '此服务器已转移到的 Coolify 实例。',
    'The SMTP password from your provider. It is required when you enter a username.' => '提供商给出的 SMTP 密码。填写用户名时此项必填。',
    'The SMTP username from your provider. Leave it empty only for a relay that does not need a login, for example a local mail server.' => '提供商给出的 SMTP 用户名。仅对无需登录的中继（例如本地邮件服务器）可以留空。',
    'The Secret from your GitLab OAuth Application. Saved encrypted.' => '你的 GitLab OAuth 应用的 Secret。保存时加密。',
    'The URL at which the other instance reaches this instance. This instance gives it a token that expires in 1 hour.' => '另一实例访问此实例所用的 URL。此实例会为其签发一个 1 小时后过期的令牌。',
    'The compose file path (' => 'Compose 文件路径（',
    'The content shown may be outdated. Click \'Load from server\' to fetch the latest version.' => '显示的内容可能已过时。点击「从服务器加载」获取最新版本。',
    'The credentials need' => '凭据需要',
    'The database file the backup replaces. Coolify preselects the file named in the backup file name.' => '此备份将覆盖的数据库文件。Coolify 会根据备份文件名预选对应文件。',
    'The health check is failing.' => '健康检查正在失败。',
    'The host Docker socket is never shared.' => '宿主机的 Docker socket 从不共享。',
    'The latest output produced while checking this server.' => '检查此服务器时产生的最新输出。',
    'The locked value cannot be shown. Leave this empty to keep it.' => '已锁定的值无法显示。留空则保留原值。',
    'The name is converted to slug format when saved.' => '保存时名称会被转换为 slug 格式。',
    'The name of the container to execute within. You can leave it blank if your application only has one container.' => '要执行命令的容器名称。若应用只有一个容器可以留空。',
    'The package manager does not install these updates. Phased rollout: Ubuntu releases the update to a part of all servers at a time, and this server gets it in a later phase. Held: a package hold (apt-mark hold) or a version pin (/etc/apk/world) on the server blocks the update.' => '包管理器不会安装这些更新。分阶段推送：Ubuntu 会把更新分批发布给部分服务器，此服务器会在稍后阶段收到。已搁置：服务器上的软件包搁置（apt-mark hold）或版本锁定（/etc/apk/world）阻止了该更新。',
    'The password variable is locked, so the URL that contains it is not shown.' => '密码变量已锁定，因此包含它的 URL 不会显示。',
    'The period in which Coolify counts failed validations. From 60 to 86400 seconds.' => 'Coolify 统计失败校验次数的时间窗口。取值 60 到 86400 秒。',
    'The public hostname of the tunnel that routes to SSH on this server, without a protocol.' => '将流量路由到此服务器 SSH 的隧道的公网主机名，不带协议。',
    'The resource may be functioning normally.' => '该资源可能仍在正常运行。',
    'The server and network used by this resource.' => '此资源使用的服务器与网络。',
    'The software packages that Coolify found in the image, with their versions and licenses. The SBOM (software bill of materials) is the full list of these packages in a standard format (CycloneDX or SPDX). Download it for audits or for other security tools.' => 'Coolify 在镜像中找到的软件包及其版本与许可证。SBOM（软件物料清单）是以标准格式（CycloneDX 或 SPDX）列出的完整软件包清单。可下载用于审计或其他安全工具。',
    'The token of the tunnel connector, from the Cloudflare dashboard.' => '隧道连接器的令牌，来自 Cloudflare 控制台。',
    'The type cannot change after creation. Create a new storage for another type.' => '创建后类型不可更改。如需其他类型请新建存储。',
    'This IP is taken from the destination server.' => '此 IP 取自目标服务器。',
    'This key is added to the Droplet automatically.' => '此密钥会自动添加到 Droplet。',
    'This key is added to the Hetzner server automatically.' => '此密钥会自动添加到 Hetzner 服务器。',
    'This key is added to the Hostinger VPS automatically.' => '此密钥会自动添加到 Hostinger VPS。',
    'This key is added to the Vultr server automatically.' => '此密钥会自动添加到 Vultr 服务器。',
    'This resource will' => '此资源将',
    'This shows the actual command that will be executed with auto-injected flags.' => '此处显示实际将执行的命令，包括自动注入的参数。',
    'Timeout in seconds. The default is 3600.' => '超时时间（秒）。默认 3600。',
    'Total request volume over time for the selected range.' => '所选时间范围内请求总量随时间的变化。',
    'Traefik and Caddy labels are both generated, so switching the proxy keeps routing working.' => 'Traefik 与 Caddy 的标签会同时生成，因此切换代理后路由仍可正常工作。',
    'Traefik and Caddy will route traffic to this container even without a health check. However, configuring a health check is recommended to ensure the resource is ready before receiving traffic.' => '即使没有健康检查，Traefik 和 Caddy 也会将流量路由到此容器。但建议配置健康检查，以确保资源在接收流量前已就绪。',
    'Traefik certificate resolver for generated HTTPS routes. Leave empty if Traefik uses your own certificates (for example Cloudflare Origin CA certificates in a dynamic configuration). Redeploy resources to apply the change.' => '为生成的 HTTPS 路由设置 Traefik 证书解析器。如果 Traefik 使用你自己的证书（例如动态配置中的 Cloudflare Origin CA 证书），请留空。重新部署资源以应用更改。',
    'Traefik supports only bcrypt. Argon2id needs the Caddy proxy, version 2.11 or newer. With Argon2id, labels generated for Traefik use bcrypt.' => 'Traefik 仅支持 bcrypt。Argon2id 需要 Caddy 代理 2.11 或更高版本。选择 Argon2id 时，为 Traefik 生成的标签仍使用 bcrypt。',
    'Trigger a deployment from an external service. Requests must include a valid Coolify API authorization token.' => '从外部服务触发部署。请求必须包含有效的 Coolify API 授权令牌。',
    'Trigger an external deployment with a valid Coolify API authorization token.' => '使用有效的 Coolify API 授权令牌触发外部部署。',
    'Unhealthy state.' => '不健康状态。',
    'Use a custom public URL when Coolify is behind a tunnel or reverse proxy.' => '当 Coolify 位于隧道或反向代理之后时，使用自定义公网 URL。',
    'Use a mutable tag such as latest or v1.2.3.' => '使用可变标签，例如 latest 或 v1.2.3。',
    'Use a published MariaDB image from Docker Hub.' => '使用 Docker Hub 上已发布的 MariaDB 镜像。',
    'Use a published MongoDB image from Docker Hub.' => '使用 Docker Hub 上已发布的 MongoDB 镜像。',
    'Use a published MySQL image from Docker Hub.' => '使用 Docker Hub 上已发布的 MySQL 镜像。',
    'Use a published PostgreSQL image from Docker Hub.' => '使用 Docker Hub 上已发布的 PostgreSQL 镜像。',
    'Use a published Redis or Valkey image from Docker Hub, for example valkey/valkey:9-alpine or redis:8.' => '使用 Docker Hub 上已发布的 Redis 或 Valkey 镜像，例如 valkey/valkey:9-alpine 或 redis:8。',
    'Use a published clickhouse/clickhouse-server image from Docker Hub.' => '使用 Docker Hub 上已发布的 clickhouse/clickhouse-server 镜像。',
    'Use a published eqalpha/keydb image from Docker Hub.' => '使用 Docker Hub 上已发布的 eqalpha/keydb 镜像。',
    'Use a published peakimages/sqlite image from Docker Hub.' => '使用 Docker Hub 上已发布的 peakimages/sqlite 镜像。',
    'Use database:collection1,collection2|database2 to exclude selected collections. Leave empty to include all databases and collections.' => '使用 database:collection1,collection2|database2 的格式排除指定集合。留空表示包含所有数据库与集合。',
    'Use every_minute, hourly, daily, weekly, monthly, yearly, or a cron expression.' => '使用 every_minute、hourly、daily、weekly、monthly、yearly，或填写 Cron 表达式。',
    'Use the 64-character digest without the sha256: prefix.' => '使用 64 位摘要，不带 sha256: 前缀。',
    'Use the EU or US New Relic Log API endpoint.' => '使用 EU 或 US 的 New Relic Log API 端点。',
    'Use the URL of your self-hosted Infisical instance, or the Infisical cloud URL.' => '填写自建 Infisical 实例的 URL，或 Infisical 云端 URL。',
    'Use these URLs to connect to the database.' => '使用这些 URL 连接数据库。',
