    'WARNING: Advanced use cases only. In raw mode your compose file is deployed as-is. Nothing is modified by Coolify and you need to configure the proxy parts. More info in the' => '警告：仅供高级用法。原始模式下你的 Compose 文件会原样部署，Coolify 不做任何修改，代理相关部分需要你自己配置。更多信息见',
    'Warn: Coolify connects and reports the new key. Enforce: Coolify refuses to connect until you trust or reset the new key, so deployments, backups, and checks on this server stop. A reinstall of the server also changes the key.' => '警告模式：Coolify 仍会连接并上报新密钥。强制模式：在你信任或重置新密钥之前 Coolify 拒绝连接，此服务器上的部署、备份与检查都会停止。重装服务器同样会改变密钥。',
    'When added, the build can reach the containers on the destination network by name. Each time a resource on the network is added or removed, the Docker build cache is invalidated. Preview deployments are never added, and no hosts are added on a build server.' => '加入后，构建过程可以通过名称访问该目标网络上的容器。每当网络中的资源被添加或移除，Docker 构建缓存都会失效。预览部署不会被加入，构建服务器上也不会添加主机记录。',
